#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:255
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_MeetChairman"
msgid ""
"Er-hem! I am the CHAIRMAN of the\n"
"POKéMON FAN CLUB!\p"
"Being the CHAIRMAN, I am naturally\n"
"the most important!\p"
"No one can best me when it comes\n"
"to raising POKéMON. No one!\p"
"Well, let me tell you about\n"
"POKéMON CONTESTS.\p"
"They're events where one can show off\n"
"POKéMON for the world to see!\p"
"However, they're held in far-off towns,\n"
"so I cannot participate often enough.\p"
"That is why we gather here to show\n"
"off our POKéMON, and have others\l"
"show us theirs.$"
msgstr ""
"咳咳！我就是\n"
"宝可梦爱好者俱乐部的会长！\p"
"既然是会长，我当然是最重要的人物！\p"
"说到培养宝可梦，\n"
"没人比得过我。没有人！\p"
"好了，\n"
"让我来跟你讲讲宝可梦华丽大赛吧。\p"
"那是能把宝可梦展示给全世界看的活动！\p"
"不过，比赛都在很远的城镇举行，\n"
"所以我没办法经常参加。\p"
"所以我们才聚集在这里，\n"
"互相展示自己的宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:272
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_LikeToSeeEnteredContestPokemon"
msgid ""
"The POKéMON of a TRAINER who has\n"
"entered a POKéMON CONTEST…\l"
"That, I would like to see.$"
msgstr ""
"参加过宝可梦华丽大赛的训练家的\n"
"宝可梦……我真想看一看啊。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:277
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_AllowMeToExamineYourPokemon"
msgid ""
"Er-hem! I see you've participated in\n"
"a POKéMON CONTEST!\p"
"Please! Allow me to examine how you\n"
"have raised your POKéMON.\p"
"It delights me no end to see POKéMON\n"
"raised by other TRAINERS.\p"
"The happy expressions of POKéMON\n"
"raised with proper care…\p"
"The kindly eyes of the TRAINER that\n"
"nurtured and raised the POKéMON…\p"
"The very thought fills my heart to\n"
"overwhelming with joy.\p"
"Oh! I do beg your pardon!\n"
"Forgive me for prattling on so!\p"
"Please! Allow me to examine how much\n"
"your POKéMON has grown!$"
msgstr ""
"咳咳！看来你参加过宝可梦华丽大赛嘛！\p"
"请！请让我看看你是怎么培养宝可梦的。\p"
"看到其他训练家培养的宝可梦，\n"
"我就高兴得不得了。\p"
"被用心照顾的宝可梦那幸福的表情……\p"
"细心培育宝可梦的\n"
"训练家那温柔的眼神……\p"
"光是想一想，\n"
"我的心中就充满了无比的喜悦。\p"
"哎呀！真是失礼了！\n"
"请原谅我说了这么多废话！\p"
"请！请让我看看你的\n"
"宝可梦成长了多少吧！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:295
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_HowIsYourPokemonGrowing"
msgid ""
"How is your POKéMON growing?\n"
"Allow me to examine it.$"
msgstr ""
"你的宝可梦成长得怎么样了？\n"
"让我看看吧。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:299
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_HmHmISee"
msgid ""
"Hm, hm…\n"
"I see…$"
msgstr "嗯，嗯……原来如此……$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:303
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_GiveMonMorePokeblocks"
msgid ""
"Hmmm… It's not bad, but it's not\n"
"good, either…\p"
"You, the TRAINER, must put more\n"
"effort into raising this POKéMON!\p"
"For instance, may I suggest that\n"
"you give it more {POKEBLOCK}S?$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……不算差，但也不算好……\p"
"你作为训练家，\n"
"必须在培养这只宝可梦上多下点功夫！\p"
"比如说，我建议你多喂它一些宝可方块，\n"
"怎么样？$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:311
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_NoSpaceForReward"
msgid ""
"Oh, my…\p"
"Your POKéMON is growing quite well,\n"
"so you deserve a reward.\p"
"Unfortunately, you have no space for\n"
"this in your BAG.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀……\p"
"你的宝可梦成长得很好，值得奖励一下。\p"
"可惜你的包包里已经没有地方放了。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:318
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_MonMostImpressiveGiveItThis"
msgid ""
"Your {STR_VAR_1}, it is growing in\n"
"a most impressive manner!\l"
"It is one fine specimen!\p"
"But! If you were to give it this,\n"
"it would grow even better! Indeed!$"
msgstr ""
"你的{STR_VAR_1}成长得非常出色！\n"
"真是优秀的宝可梦！\p"
"但是！如果你把这个给它，\n"
"它会成长得更好！没错！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:325
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ExplainRedScarf"
msgid ""
"Let a POKéMON hold that RED SCARF.\p"
"Everyone will recognize the coolness\n"
"of that POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"让宝可梦携带那条红色头巾吧。\p"
"大家都会认可那只宝可梦的帅气！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:330
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ExplainBlueScarf"
msgid ""
"Let a POKéMON hold that BLUE SCARF.\p"
"Its beauty will be accentuated much\n"
"more than now!$"
msgstr ""
"让宝可梦携带那条蓝色头巾吧。\p"
"它的美丽会比现在更加突出！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:335
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ExplainPinkScarf"
msgid ""
"Let a POKéMON hold that PINK SCARF.\p"
"It will draw out the cuteness of\n"
"the POKéMON some more!$"
msgstr ""
"让宝可梦携带那条粉红头巾吧。\p"
"它能让宝可梦更加可爱！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:340
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ExplainGreenScarf"
msgid ""
"Let a POKéMON hold that GREEN SCARF.\p"
"That will enhance the\n"
"smartness of POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"让宝可梦携带那条绿色头巾吧。\p"
"它能提升宝可梦的聪明！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:345
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ExplainYellowScarf"
msgid ""
"Let a POKéMON hold that YELLOW SCARF.\p"
"It will bolster your POKéMON's\n"
"toughness so much more!$"
msgstr ""
"让宝可梦携带那条黄色头巾吧。\p"
"它能让你的宝可梦更加强壮！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:350
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_NothingElseToGiveYou"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but I've nothing else to\n"
"give you! None at all!\p"
"After all, you're blessed with the gift\n"
"of raising POKéMON without resorting\l"
"to any items!$"
msgstr ""
"抱歉，我已经没有别的东西可以给你了！\n"
"一样都没有了！\p"
"毕竟你拥有不靠任何道具就\n"
"能培养好宝可梦的天赋嘛！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:357
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ShowMePokemonThatLoveYou"
msgid ""
"I love seeing POKéMON that love\n"
"their TRAINERS.\p"
"POKéMON are very sensitive to\n"
"the feelings of their TRAINERS.\p"
"If you treat your POKéMON with love\n"
"and care, they'll love you back.\p"
"When your POKéMON grow to love you,\n"
"please come show me.$"
msgstr ""
"我喜欢看到喜爱自己训练家的宝可梦。\p"
"宝可梦对训练家的心情非常敏感。\p"
"只要你用爱心好好照顾宝可梦，\n"
"它们也会同样爱你。\p"
"等你的宝可梦变得喜欢你了，\n"
"请带来给我看看。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:367
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_PokemonAdoresYou"
msgid ""
"Your POKéMON really adores you.\p"
"For you, a most compassionate\n"
"TRAINER, a gift from the FAN CLUB!$"
msgstr ""
"你的宝可梦真的很喜欢你。\p"
"送给你这位最有爱心的训练家，\n"
"这是爱好者俱乐部的礼物！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:372
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_TreatPokemonWithLove"
msgid ""
"POKéMON are very sensitive to\n"
"the feelings of their TRAINERS.\p"
"If you treat your POKéMON with love\n"
"and care, they'll love you back.$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦对训练家的心情非常敏感。\p"
"只要你用爱心好好照顾宝可梦，\n"
"它们也会同样爱你。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:378
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_PokemonDontLikeFainting"
msgid ""
"If you keep letting a POKéMON faint\n"
"in battle, it'll come to resent it.\p"
"Soon, it will become less trusting\n"
"of the TRAINER.\p"
"In other words, it certainly won't\n"
"like you very much.$"
msgstr ""
"如果总是让宝可梦在战斗中倒下，\n"
"它就会心生怨恨。\p"
"很快，它就会变得不太信任训练家了。\p"
"换句话说，它肯定不会太喜欢你的。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:386
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_MonEnjoyedProtein"
msgid ""
"Do POKéMON enjoy having items used\n"
"on them?\p"
"Mine acted really happy when I gave\n"
"it some PROTEIN.$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦喜欢别人对它使用道具吗？\p"
"我给我的宝可梦用了攻击增强剂，\n"
"它看起来非常高兴。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:392
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_Skitty"
msgid "SKITTY: Fffnyaaaah…$"
msgstr "向尾喵：呋喵啊啊……$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:395
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_Zigzagoon"
msgid "ZIGZAGOON: Kyuuu…$"
msgstr "蛇纹熊：啾——……$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub/scripts.inc:398
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_Azumarill"
msgid "AZUMARILL: Marimari?$"
msgstr "玛力露丽：玛丽玛丽？$"
